nce about retaliation is not evidence that none occurred.", ""], ["", "br"], ["¶ ", "red"], ["Use historical, aggregate or consented material for political cases. Never produce person-level or site-level maps of living networks.", ""], ["", "br"], ["¶ ", "red"], ["Tag provenance: inspected evidence, secondary synthesis, or model-generated hypothesis.", ""], ["", "br"], ["¶ ", "red"], ["Set the smallest useful gain and the acceptable error burden before running a confirmatory comparison.", ""]]}, {"id": "s19", "x": 786, "y": 1095.368, "w": 168, "size": 22, "font": "Sue Ellen Francisco", "color": "#a3271b", "runs": [["Do not repair the witness to fit the instrument.", ""]], "lh": 24.6, "para_gap": 4}, {"id": "folio", "x": 420, "y": 1548, "w": 160, "size": 12, "lh": 16, "font": "IM FELL English SC", "ls": 0.2, "align": "center", "color": "#6d5f4b", "runs": [["11 · 1", ""]]}]